### Register
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/public/auth/auth?username=admin&email=admin@test.com&password=admin123

### Login
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/public/auth/login?username=admin&password=admin123

### Me
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/public/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Create genre
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/admin/genres
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"name": "Action", "description": "Action anime"}

### List genres
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/genres

### Create anime
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/admin/anime?genreIds=1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"title": "Naruto", "description": "Ninja story", "status": "COMPLETED", "releaseYear": 2002}

### List anime
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/anime?page=0&size=10

### Get anime
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/anime/1

### Search anime
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/anime/search?q=naruto

### Upload cover (use file picker in IDE)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/admin/anime/1/cover
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=boundary

--boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="cover.jpg"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

< ./cover.jpg
--boundary--

### Create episode
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/admin/episodes/anime/1?episodeNumber=1&title=Pilot
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### List episodes
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/episodes/anime/1

### Stream video
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/stream/video/1

### Add to watchlist
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/watchlist/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get watchlist
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/watchlist
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Toggle favorite
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/watchlist/1/favorite
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get favorites
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/watchlist/favorites
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Remove from watchlist
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/v1/watchlist/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
